# Secrets and credential files: never commit. This repo is public, and it holds
# only specification text and diagram pages, so nothing here should ever match.
# Filename patterns cannot judge content; gitleaks scans contents and is the
# real guard. The set follows safe-agents' .gitignore, where the specs are
# authored (2026-10-28).
.env*
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
.secrets*
credentials.json
secrets.yml
secrets.yaml
*_key.txt
*_token.txt
*_secret.txt

# Editor and OS files
.DS_Store
